opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis:
  "Calculations for the WH-347 certified payroll form (Rev. January 2025)"
description:
  "Calculations for one line and one week of the U.S. Department of Labor WH-347 certified payroll form, revised version (Rev. January 2025), used on Davis-Bacon and Related Acts contracts. Given a worker's week (base rate, fringe rates per plan, straight-time and overtime hours per day, cash in lieu of fringe, deductions), the library computes columns 5 to 9 of the form, per-plan fringe totals for the crew, and a reconciliation check. No dependencies beyond the standard library, no I/O. OCaml port of the Go package codeberg.org/tresor2k/tabletemplates-go/wh347 and the Rust crate wh347."
maintainer: ["TableTemplates <support@tabletemplates.com>"]
